WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
Think about this: What does the completion
record mean?

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:04.920
Let’s work through it together.

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:10.880
I'm Doctor Gainz. Lesson 24: Complete a
thirty-day practice plan.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:16.000
Week one: learn the terminology,
distinguish sale types, and build a

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.240
three-program official-source inventory.
Week two: check local requirements

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:24.220
and practice permissioned intake with
fictional material.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:29.200
Week three: assemble the fictional
document index, event log, and

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:33.980
illustrative accounting scenarios. Week
four: complete a source-linked

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:36.880
handoff brief and review every unresolved
issue.

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:42.060
Measure work quality: sources dated,
unknowns preserved, restrictions

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.480
recorded, permissions scoped, and
calculations checked.

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:49.700
Do not use a dollar-income target as
evidence that the process works.

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:54.120
When moving beyond practice, use
authorized client material and the

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:58.440
appropriate qualified review before
offering regulated activities or fees.

00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:02.720
Finishing the lessons and knowledge checks
earns an educational completion

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:03.740
record in this course.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:08.520
It is not a license, professional
certification, legal qualification, or

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:13.000
promise of earnings. Your practical next
step is the specific permitted task

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.220
your evidence supports. Pause and try
this.

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:20.960
Write a thirty-day learning plan with four
weekly deliverables and one stop

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:25.280
condition. Finish the capstone using
fictional records before proceeding to

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:28.160
authorized case work. Quick knowledge
check.

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:30.500
What does the completion record mean?

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:35.640
The answer: Completion of this educational
course and its practice checks.

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:38.620
Course completion records learning
progress only.

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:42.000
Keep the source, the date, and the
unknowns visible.

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:43.880
I'll see you in the next lesson.
